  "details": "- CVE-2026-27142: fix missing escaping of URLs in meta tag content attributes\n  in html/template by tracking the url= portion of the content attribute and\n  applying URL escaping (prerequisite for CVE-2026-39823)\n- CVE-2026-39826: fix escaper bypass in html/template by treating script type\n  attributes that are empty or whitespace-only as JavaScript\n- CVE-2026-39825: fix query parameter smuggling in net/http/httputil\n  ReverseProxy by reencoding outbound queries that exceed the\n  urlmaxqueryparams limit so Rewrite hooks cannot be bypassed\n- CVE-2026-39819: fix 'go bug' writing files with predictable names in the\n  system temporary directory by creating a private directory with\n  os.MkdirTemp, preventing symlink-based file overwrite\n- CVE-2026-39817: fix 'go tool pack' extracting archive entries to arbitrary\n  filesystem locations by refusing to extract files with directory components\n- CVE-2026-39823: fix XSS in html/template where ASCII whitespace around the\n  '=' rune in a meta tag content attribute URL bypassed URL escaping",
